# Hardware Node Inventory File
# Format: mac,ip,component_id,nid
#
# Fields:
#   mac           - MAC address of the node's PXE boot NIC (XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX)
#   ip            - Static IP address to assign to the node
#   component_id  - XName / Component ID (e.g., x1000c0s0b0n0)
#   nid           - Numeric Node ID (unique positive integer)
#
# Usage:
#   cp nodes.csv.example nodes.csv
#   # Edit nodes.csv with your hardware inventory
#   ./deploy.sh --method minikube --mode hardware --interface ens160 \
#     --ip 148.187.1.68 --cidr 28 --dhcp-start 148.187.1.69 --dhcp-end 148.187.1.78 \
#     --nodes-file nodes.csv
#
50:6b:4b:d5:1d:5d,148.187.1.69,x1000c0s0b0n0,1000
AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01,148.187.1.70,x1000c0s1b0n0,1001
